      "problem": "$$\n\n$\\operatorname{csch}⁡(-2\\operatorname{ln}⁡2)=$",
      "worked_solution": "$$\n\nThe definition of $\\operatorname{csch}⁡x$ is \n\n$$\n\\operatorname{csch}⁡x=\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{sinh}⁡x}=\\frac{2}{{e}^{x}-{e}^{-x}}.\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{csch}⁡(-2\\operatorname{ln}⁡2) & =\\frac{2}{{e}^{-2\\operatorname{ln}⁡2}-{e}^{-(-2\\operatorname{ln}⁡2)}} \\\\  & =\\frac{2}{{e}^{-2\\operatorname{ln}⁡2}-{e}^{2\\operatorname{ln}⁡2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{2}{{e}^{\\operatorname{ln}⁡{2}^{-2}}-{e}^{\\operatorname{ln}⁡{2}^{2}}} \\\\  & =\\frac{2}{{2}^{-2}-{2}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{2}{(\\frac{1}{4}-4)} \\\\  & =\\frac{2}{(-\\frac{15}{4})} \\\\  & =-\\frac{8}{15}.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
